# This repository is intentionally README-only for now ("ignore everything
# else"). Delete these lines to start tracking the project.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Note for later: the application lives in instinct-series/ and already has its
# own git history. It is ignored here on purpose. If you later want the app
# published from this repository, remove the block above and then either move
# instinct-series/* up to the root, or delete instinct-series/.git so its files
# become ordinary tracked files here.
#
# Do not just drop the ignore and `git add .` while instinct-series/.git still
# exists: git will record it as an embedded repository (a gitlink) and upload
# a broken reference instead of the source.
